DATA LAYER
  Web hooks ported (same names at the Swift call sites): useIsForwardAuth, useVehicles.
  The catalog is static + client-side (the only live inputs are the two gates +
  recents), so LiveExploreSource reads `VehicleDirectoryStore.load().count`
  (useVehicles → count gate) + `RecentRoutesStore.recents`, with forward-auth
  (useIsForwardAuth) injected via a provider closure (no native auth-mode store yet;
  defaults false = self-hosted non-forward-auth). Every state binds through the
  @Observable ExploreModel (P1/S8). loading→redacted skeleton; empty→ContentUnavailable-
  style GlassPanel; error→TSErrorDisplay+Retry; success→section bands.

